msgid "only displays a message; it does not cancel the order."
msgstr ""

#: src/lib/generated-docs-from-md-files/@taon-dev/e-commerce/README.component.html:35
msgid "Canceling subscription renewal retains access through the paid period end; that deadline is enforced even if the final cancellation webhook is delayed. Actual cancellation, unpaid, paused and expired states remove access."
msgstr ""

#: src/lib/generated-docs-from-md-files/@taon-dev/e-commerce/README.component.html:38
msgid "retains access during Stripe's retry/dunning window; configure Stripe's final failed-payment action to cancel or mark the subscription unpaid when that window ends. Invoices update payment history and reconcile the current subscription period and status, including when delivered before checkout completion."
msgstr ""

#: src/lib/generated-docs-from-md-files/@taon-dev/e-commerce/README.component.html:43
msgid "Full refunds and full-amount lost disputes for normal/lifetime Checkout payments mark the order/payment refunded and revoke that order's entitlements. Partial refunds and partial lost disputes leave access intact. Other purchases and directly assigned permissions are not revoked. A refunded lifetime purchase can be purchased again."
msgstr ""

#: src/lib/generated-docs-from-md-files/@taon-dev/e-commerce/README.component.html:47
msgid "Product presentation and eligibility"
msgstr ""

#: src/lib/generated-docs-from-md-files/@taon-dev/e-commerce/README.component.html:48
msgid "Use the product editor's <strong>Link to post</strong> field to associate a CMS post. Published\npost titles, excerpts, public content and thumbnails enrich the product details\ndialog. Protected post bodies and video/audio/file attachments are not exposed\nby the sales preview. Product thumbnails reuse CMS storage/download tokens,\nincluding for posts whose full content requires purchase."
msgstr ""

#: src/lib/generated-docs-from-md-files/@taon-dev/e-commerce/README.component.html:53
msgid "Product information opens a normal details dialog from Buy, Cart and Checkout; purchase, quantity and remove controls are separate. List thumbnails are bounded to 100px height, checkout thumbnails to 50px, preserving aspect ratio. Neither list downloads full post media attachments."
msgstr ""

#: src/lib/generated-docs-from-md-files/@taon-dev/e-commerce/README.component.html:57
msgid "The backend exposes"
